s and energetic attitude. It also allows her to interact with her secret crush and savior, the night class' dorm president, Kaname Kuran. Zero, on the other hand, has a deep-rooted hatred against vampires, and at times, does not hesitate to kill.\n\nCan vampires and humans co-exist, even in the strict setup of the Cross Academy? Only time will tell.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Shoujo","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Vampire","rank":94,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Boarding School","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Amnesia","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Incest","rank":65,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Male Harem","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Adoption","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Politics","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Twins","rank":60,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Kuudere","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Unrequited Love","rank":40,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":20,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Guns","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Vampire Knight","english":"Vampire Knight","native":"ヴァンパイア騎士","romaji":"Vampire Knight","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"吸血鬼骑士"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}